femto patch for epub-stream 0.1.0
Subject: book tests: read fixtures from the femto repository

The published crate excludes tests/fixtures/, so the unit tests in
src/book.rs that open the accessibility and Frankenstein EPUBs cannot run
from the crate archive. Point them at femto's own fixtures
(../../tests/fixtures/book-api.epub and book-api-legacy-cover.epub relative
to the crate, generated by scripts/make-fixtures.py), rename the two
cover tests accordingly, tighten a few assertions to the known fixture
contents, and add a test for navigation and exact cover bytes.

femto-specific: the paths only resolve inside the femto repository.

